        "product_id": 1005009993325314,
        "detail": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">DescriptionPerfect Size: Each tee measures 3.24 inches (83m), an ideal size for a wide range of golf balls, ensuring versatility for both practice and competitive play.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Multicolor : Comes in a vibrant multicolor pack that not only adds a touch of style to your game but also helps in easy visibility on the golf course.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Low Friction Design: The smooth surface reduces friction upon impact, providing a cleaner contact and improved ball flight for better game performance.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Premium Durability: Made from high-quality materials, these tees boast enhanced durability and resistance to wear, suitable for repeated use in all weather conditions.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">360° Flexibility: Caiton golf tees are designed with unique 360° flexibility to adjust and bend without breaking, allowing optimal setup and consistency in your game.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S0ab48bfd5d4d44478223ca0485c09cebT.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Sdcc2b5fe5a4143b8a2ead1fe8deb24f92.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S7bda284a0acf493fbe3782a6d4bc39a2o.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S0250e9d7f7d24dcd8cf71c6665607a3cy.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S8dad0201094246e8aca5a85f708cc3048.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/S8abcb8a47c4745989fc2c5b65b9d192a9.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\"/><br/></p>"
